<script setup lang="ts">
import {vRememberDisclosure} from './rememberDisclosure'
import type {RemainingReport,RemainingClass,RemainingUpdate} from './v6RemainingTypes'
defineProps<{value?:RemainingReport|null}>()
const fmt=(n:number|null|undefined,d=1)=>n==null?'—':n.toLocaleString('zh-TW',{maximumFractionDigits:d,minimumFractionDigits:d})
const sign=(n:number)=>`${n>0?'+':''}${fmt(n)}`
const probability=(cs:RemainingClass[],key:string)=>cs.find(c=>c.key===key)?.probability_pct
const change=(u:RemainingUpdate,old:RemainingClass[],key:string)=>{const a=probability(u.classes,key),b=probability(old,key);return a==null||b==null?null:a-b}
const names:Record<string,string>={up:'上漲',flat:'平盤',down:'下跌'}
</script>
<template>
 <section class="remaining-panel" aria-label="原預報剩餘期間更新">
  <header><div><small>FIXED DEADLINE · MANUAL REVISIONS</small><h3>原預報追蹤 · 剩餘2日／1日</h3></div><span>原起點與到期日固定</span></header>
  <p class="explanation">上方是新一輪三日預報；這裡追蹤先前尚未到期的預報。加入已發生的收盤變化，更新剩餘期間的歷史基準，不改寫原值。</p>
  <p v-if="!value?.groups.length" class="empty">{{value?.note||'尚無新方法的滾動紀錄。下一次在對話更新V6、且前次預報已經過1或2個交易日，才會保存修訂；舊版相似日預報不回填。'}}</p>
  <article v-for="g in value?.groups" :key="g.root_id" class="remaining-group">
   <div class="group-title"><div><b>{{g.original_market_as_of}} 起點 {{fmt(g.anchor,2)}} 點</b><small>固定到期 {{g.target_date}}</small></div><span class="status" :class="g.latest.status">{{g.latest.status==='complete'?'已到期核對':g.latest.status==='unavailable'?'等待資料':'剩餘'+g.latest.remaining_sessions+'個交易日'}}</span></div>
   <template v-if="g.latest.status==='reference'"><p class="current">更新至 {{g.latest.market_as_of}} 收盤 {{fmt(g.latest.current_close,2)}}，相對原起點 {{sign(g.latest.realized_return_pct||0)}}%。</p><div class="remaining-probabilities"><div v-for="c in g.latest.classes" :key="c.key" :class="c.key"><small>原到期日{{c.label}}</small><strong>{{fmt(c.probability_pct)}}<em>%</em></strong><span v-if="change(g.latest,g.original_classes,c.key)!=null">較最初 {{sign(change(g.latest,g.original_classes,c.key)!)}} 百分點</span></div></div><p class="event" v-if="g.latest.event"><b>{{g.latest.event.label}}</b><span v-if="g.latest.event.status==='reference'"> 歷史基準 {{fmt((g.latest.event.probability||0)*100)}}%</span><span v-else> · 已發生的觀察，不是未來機率</span></p><p class="limitations">已反映前段走勢，但沒有估計「跌後更容易續跌或反彈」。這是剩餘期間基準，尚未證明預測力提升。</p></template>
   <div v-else-if="g.latest.status==='complete'" class="completed"><b>{{g.target_date}} 實際{{names[g.latest.actual_class||'']||'待核對'}} {{sign(g.latest.actual_return_pct||0)}}%</b><p>{{g.latest.event?.label}} · {{g.latest.verified_on}} 保存核對。原機率與各次修訂保留。</p></div>
   <p v-else class="missing">{{g.latest.note}}；保留原預報，這次不顯示新的百分比。</p>
   <details v-remember-disclosure="'v6.remaining.'+g.root_id"><summary>查看原預報與每次修訂</summary><div class="history-scroll" tabindex="0" aria-label="預報修訂紀錄，可左右捲動"><table><thead><tr><th>保存時間／資料日</th><th>版本</th><th>上漲</th><th>平盤</th><th>下跌</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>{{g.original_issued_at.slice(0,16).replace('T',' ')}}<small>{{g.original_market_as_of}}</small></td><td>最初3日</td><td v-for="k in ['up','flat','down']" :key="k">{{fmt(probability(g.original_classes,k))}}%</td></tr><tr v-for="u in g.updates" :key="u.issued_at+'-'+u.market_as_of"><td>{{u.issued_at.slice(0,16).replace('T',' ')}}<small>{{u.market_as_of}}</small></td><td>{{u.status==='complete'?'到期核對':u.status==='unavailable'?'資料不足':'剩餘'+u.remaining_sessions+'日'}}</td><template v-if="u.status==='reference'"><td v-for="k in ['up','flat','down']" :key="k">{{fmt(probability(u.classes,k))}}%</td></template><td v-else colspan="3">{{u.status==='complete'?'實際'+names[u.actual_class||'']+' '+sign(u.actual_return_pct||0)+'%':u.note}}</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p v-if="g.latest.median_level">剩餘期間期末中位 {{fmt(g.latest.median_level)}} 點；成熟歷史 {{g.latest.sample_n?.toLocaleString()}} 筆。</p><p v-for="band in g.latest.intervals" :key="band.central_pct">歷史中央{{band.central_pct}}%：{{fmt(band.low_level)}}～{{fmt(band.high_level)}}點。不是保證涵蓋率。</p><p v-if="g.latest.status==='reference'&&!g.latest.timing_qualified">此筆為提前保存參考，不列入08:30版本的前瞻統計。</p><p>{{g.latest.note}}</p></details>
  </article>
  <details v-remember-disclosure="'v6.remaining.summary'" class="tracking-summary"><summary>新方法累積核對 {{value?.summary.completed||0}} 組</summary><p>符合原預報08:30保存條件：{{value?.summary.prospective_qualified||0}} 組<span v-if="value?.summary.original_mean_rps!=null">；最初三日機率的平均RPS {{fmt(value.summary.original_mean_rps,4)}}（越低越好）</span>。</p><p v-for="s in value?.summary.remaining_scores" :key="s.remaining_sessions">剩餘{{s.remaining_sessions}}日修訂：{{s.n}}組<span v-if="s.mean_rps!=null">，平均RPS {{fmt(s.mean_rps,4)}}</span>。</p><p>{{value?.note||'還沒有到期的真正保存紀錄，不能宣稱準確率提升。'}}</p><p>原預報與剩餘期間修訂掌握的資訊不同，誤差降低也可能只是多看了已發生的行情，不等於新增方向優勢。</p></details>
 </section>
</template>
